1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 { Opens the centre at once. } 3... cxd5 4. c4 { Challenges d5 straight away. } 4... Nf6
5. Nc3 { Adds a second attacker on d5. } 5... e6 6. Nf3 Be7 7. cxd5 { Takes, so Black must recapture and the centre is open. } 7... Nxd5
8. Bd3 { Aims at h7 with the queen's help later. } 8... Nc6 9. O-O O-O 10. Re1 *
